'''''Wanderer, Decipher the Waxen Imprints''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Before Their Deaths]].

==Steps==
# Explore Exomyth again
# Help, Madam Herta!
# Try to seek help through the power of Paths
# Find the path back to Amphoreus
# Return to Amphoreus
# Go meet March!
# Leave with March 7th...?
# Expose "March 7th's" disguise

