===Explore Exomyth again{{subst:void|<!--104060701-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location="Exomyth"|Here, you'll hear no human voices, see no human shadows. The sun's flickering flames will scorch you, draining the color from your skin. Only when the starlit night shields you from sunlight, or when the Sun rises to melt away the morning frost, will you find relief. These present hardships will torture you forever, and no one can save you.<br />But you have left behind the fire... the fire that will liberate them. And the fire meant to free you was illuminated long ago.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
----
:{{tx}}
:'''Lygus's Voice:''' Since we parted ways last time, I have modified the Exomyth into an "audience area" exclusive to you. Now, you'll be able to silently wait here for the final act of Amphoreus to begin.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let me out!
::'''Lygus's Voice:''' I understand your anger, but I cannot allow you to continuously influence the extrapolation's progress.
::Don't make me hurt you.
::'''Lygus's Voice:''' Heh, it seems you have already forgotten... We can't hurt each other in this place.
::I'm the player! Not the audience!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Don't make me hurt you.
::'''Lygus's Voice:''' Heh, it seems you have already forgotten... We can't hurt each other in this place.
::I'm the player! Not the audience!
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm the player! Not the audience!
:'''Lygus's Voice:''' We always feel so powerless before fate, don't we?
:'''Lygus's Voice:''' This could in fact be a wonderful opportunity for you. From the audience's perspective, you may better observe the workings of the Erudition at a macroscopic level.
:'''Lygus's Voice:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|In this place, where time flows far slower than within Amphoreus, you will witness... the end of that world's saga.}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What exactly are you after?
::'''Lygus's Voice:''' The answer concerning "the prime mover of life," and...
::'''Lygus's Voice:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|...the total destruction of the Erudition.}}
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You... also hate the Aeons?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Aren't you an Emanator of Erudition?
::'''Lygus's Voice:''' Do you see me as THEIR faithful disciple?
::{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Where time flows... slower than within Amphoreus?
::'''Lygus's Voice:''' Indeed. The speed of time here is infinitesimally close to that of the real universe you're familiar with.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'll definitely find a way out of here.
::'''Lygus's Voice:''' Oh, I am not doubting your capacity to create miracles.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What exactly are you after?
:'''Lygus's Voice:''' The answer concerning "the prime mover of life," and...
:'''Lygus's Voice:''' {{Цвет|Ключевой|nobold=1|...the total destruction of the Erudition.}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You... also hate the Aeons?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Aren't you an Emanator of Erudition?
:'''Lygus's Voice:''' Do you see me as THEIR faithful disciple?
:{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

===Help, Madam Herta!{{subst:void|<!--104060702-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Unused &mdash; DistrictTrigger_G3)
:{{tx}}
::'''Herta:''' That old Intellitron overlooked one little detail, and Screwy and I finally found an opportunity.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Save me, Madam Herta!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What's happening outside?
::'''Herta:''' Let's keep it short. While you were gone... well, in those few years, Amphoreus...
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Wait. A few years!?
::'''Herta:''' Yes. Time dilation, resulting in an uneven flow... Don't you know this already?
::'''Herta:''' Let's stick to the main points. The Chrysos Heirs activated the Chronocognitive Anchor and helped Screwllum and me open a hole in the "firewall." We made some adjustments, so he can't attack us immediately, but it won't hold for long...
::'''Strange Display Monitor:''' {{Цвет|Огненный|[Abnormal data, locked on. Unauthorized communication, confirmed. Initiating response...]}}
::'''Herta:''' Tch. Time is running out. Here's the conclusion...
::'''Herta:''' It'll probably take a long time for Screwy and me to completely break this cage before the Chrysos Heirs have a full grasp of the "Law"...
::'''Herta:''' To be safe, we'll continue to launch side-channel attacks on the system to give you opportunities to escape. You need to seize these opportunities. Now, start moving and find a way to pull off a magnificent jailbreak.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So... how should I do that?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} ...That's all you have to say?
::'''Herta:''' We detected... another... Path's... influence...
::{{tx}}
:'''Strange Display Monitor:''' {{Цвет|Огненный|[Warning. Abnormal data transmission detected...]}}
:'''Herta:''' Hurry up. Put some speed into it! I can't keep this up for much longer.
{{Dialogue End}}

